{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-homological-shell-condensation-motivation","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:homological-shell-condensation-motivation","kind":"remark","title":"Motivation: the Białynicki-Birula spectral sequence and shell closure","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-homological-shell-condensation"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-homological-shell-condensation","tags":["brane-tower","bialynicki-birula","spectral-sequence","shell-condensation"],"text":"homological-shell-condensation-motivation.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:homological-shell-condensation-motivation\"></a><p>The Białynicki-Birula stratification of the brane tower\n(<a href=\"#def:recursive-brane-tower\" data-at=\"lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation\">recursive-brane-tower</a>,\n<a href=\"#ex:brane-tower-levels\" data-at=\"lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation\">brane-tower-levels</a>) under the <a class=\"refterm\" href=\"#term-descent\">descent</a>\ninvolution <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat\\tau</code>\n(<a href=\"#def:descent-involution\"><a class=\"refterm\" href=\"#term-descent\">descent</a>-involution</a>) yields a spectral\nsequence whose <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">E_\\infty</code> page records the failure of categorical\nneutrality at each level. The proposition names the <strong>homological\ncondensation</strong> at saturated <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code>. The higher pages collapse to zero,\nencoding shell closure as an algebraic-geometry condition on the\nbrane-tower stratification.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/homological-shell-condensation-motivation.md","heading":"Remark","number":"11.1.31","page":"b/rem-homological-shell-condensation-motivation","qa":{"counts":{"pass":44,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":23,"unknown":0,"stale":67}}}
